meta {
  name: Leave Trip
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/trips/{{tripId}}/leave
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # Leave Trip

  Leave a trip you're a member of.

  **Permission Required:** Any member (viewer, editor, or owner)

  **Notes:**
  - Any member can leave a trip voluntarily
  - Cannot leave if you're the last owner (at least one owner must remain)
  - Permanently removes your membership
  - You'll lose all access to the trip
  - Creates an activity log entry
}
